    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Lappin Estates take great pleasure in presenting Apartment 55 Belgrove Park, just a short stroll from the beautiful and extensive St Annes Park. This is an extremely bright and spacious 2 bedroomed dual aspect ground floor apartment with generous well proportioned living accommodation. Set in a mature residential enclave, accessed via electronic vehicular and pedestrian gates, this appealing development is a popular choice for owners and investors alike.\r\nWith a designated secure underground car space and lift services to all floors, once inside No 55, there is a  welcoming reception hall with polished floors and large walk in storage closet.  The expansive lounge/dining room also with polished floor is light-filled and is a very practical size. The kitchen has access from both the lounge/dining room and the hall.  With ample Cherrywood floor and wall units, there is space for a breakfast table or extra storage.\r\n\r\nBenefitting from a truly prime location, in a highly sought after and mature locale, close to a myriad of sports and leisure facilities (Clontarf, St Annes and Royal Dublin Golf Clubs, Clontarf Lawn Tennis Club, Rugby Club, Yacht Club, Cricket Club, GAA Club, CRC Swimming Pool, Dollymount Strand & Bird Sanctuary, The Bull Wall, Clontarf Prom & Cycling Track etc)\r\n\r\nThe lovely atmospheric Clontarf village offers plenty of boutique shopping facilities as well as a selection of bars and eateries.  The renowned Nolans supermarket and adjacent shops and café offer a fantastic local amenity.  A number of great schools are easily accessible as is East Point Business Park, The East Link Toll Bridge and Dublin airport. Raheny, Sutton, Howth and Malahide are all within easy distance and all offer their own unique facilities including a huge selection of water sports, walking trails and cliff walks.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, living/dining room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and terrace.  Secure underground parking and landscaped communal grounds.  Viewing is very highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\tSolid wooden floor, hot press, security intercom, large utility plumbed for washing machine with storage.\r\nLiving/Dining Room\t6.76m x 4.60m\tSolid wooden flooring, door to outside terrace with decking. Open plan to the kitchen.\r\nKitchen\t3.40m x 2.96m\tWooden flooring, modern wall and floor mounted units with integrated dishwasher, fridge freezer, cooker, hob and part tiled walls.\r\nBedroom 1)\t5.55m x 3.12m\tWooden flooring, fully fitted wardrobes, ensuite and floor to ceiling windows.\r\nEn-suite\t\tTiled walls and floor, WC, whb, shower and extractor fan.\r\nBedroom 2)\t3.41m x 2.60m\tWooden flooring and fitted wardrobe.\r\nOutside\t\tLandscaped communal garden. Private terrace. Secure underground parking space #55\r\n\r\nNegotiator:\tPaul Lappin Office:  01 8825730   \r\n\r\nViewing:\tViewing by appointment with Property Team Lappin Estates \r\n\r\nCALL 01 8825730 TO HAVE YOUR HOME VALUED FOR FREE"
      },
      {
